Subject: [PATCH] feat(M706-M725): Historical Battle Intelligence Live Fusion
 pipeline

Phase AX: 20 modules for fusing Seraphine-style historical opponent data
with the real-time decision loop (M686-M705).

New modules:
- M706 opponent_history_aggregator: Multi-source history aggregation w/ dedup + TTL cache
- M707 live_opponent_scout: Real-time opponent scouting w/ threat scoring + weakness detection
- M708 historical_matchup_win_predictor: Bayesian win probability from historical matchups
- M709 history_aware_draft_advisor: Ban/pick advice from opponent history + meta data
- M710 opponent_tendency_live_tracker: Live behavior vs historical baseline z-score deviation
- M711 historical_itemization_advisor: Matchup-specific item build recommendations
- M712 lane_matchup_history_enricher: Live lane state enriched with historical averages
- M713 team_composition_history_analyzer: Team comp archetype + synergy + H2H analysis
- M714 opponent_tilt_detector: Tilt detection from losing streaks + death spikes + champ hopping
- M715 historical_objective_priority_advisor: Time-dependent objective win rate impact
- M716 pregame_strategy_synthesizer: All intel sources -> structured pregame briefing
- M717 history_confidence_calibrator: Multi-factor confidence calibration (samples/recency/patch/source)
- M718 live_history_event_correlator: Live events -> historical pattern similarity matching
- M719 opponent_champion_pool_predictor: Recency-weighted champion pick probability prediction
- M720 historical_power_spike_advisor: Level/item/time-based power spike windows
- M721 cross_match_pattern_detector: Recurring behavior detection across multiple matches
- M722 history_driven_voice_briefer: TTS-optimized pregame + live voice briefings
- M723 opponent_adaptation_tracker: Within-game + cross-game adaptation detection
- M724 historical_intel_cache_manager: Centralized LRU cache w/ namespace + TTL + stats
- M725 history_to_live_fusion_orchestrator: Top-level orchestrator for entire intel pipeline

Tests: 70 tests (10 per key module), all passing.
Plan: Updated with M706-M725 (completed) + M726-M745 (next phase defined).

Reference: github.com/ljszx/Seraphine (historical data patterns)
